 #27710
 Garrawa~
 Garrawa~
 Garrawa is sitting here, lost in thought.
 ~
 This man is wearing extravagant clothing from the great artistic trading centers
 of the realms. Although extremely old, they have been relatively well cared for.
 He was once considered among the great philosophers of Old Singase but now he is
 tolerated, his mind slipping due to his extreme age. While Old Singasis now
 consider him a worthless old man, his vast knowledge and wisdom would be well
 worth your time. He is one of a very few left in Old Singase who were here in
 the heyday of the town.
 ~
