 >all_greet_prog 40~
  say Who sent you to me?
 ~
 >all_greet_prog 55~
  say Oh, for the days of
  say Rrrb the Benevolent and
  say his personal guard,
  say Lord Protector Yzzat the Terrible!
  say Rumour has it their descendants
  say still wander the realms.
 ~
 >speech_prog p A bird in the hand is worth two in the bush.~
  if quest(0,5,$n) == 16
  tell $n Very good!
  tell $n I didn't expect the right answer coming from the likes
  tell $n of you!
  mpoload 27727
  mpquiet on
  cast 'remove curse'
  mpquiet off
  give i27727 $n
  mpjunk i27727
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 17
  tell $n If you wanna try another test, see Ganngalida and tell
  tell $n him I sent you.
  mpechoat $n You walk out with a sense of pride.
  mpechoaround $n $n swaggers out of Garrawa's abode, head held high.
  mptransfer $n 27714
  else
  if quest(0,5,$n) == 18
  tell $n I told you where to go, now get out of my house!
  mptransfer $n 27799
  endif
  endif
 ~
 >speech_prog ~
  if quest(0,5,$n) == 16
  rofl
  tell $n This has proven to be my lucky day! I had a bet with
  tell $n Bidanggu that I would fool you.
  mpecho Garrawa rubs his hands together in great excitement.
  tell $n Go to Bidanggu and say 'another failure coming to
  tell $n see you' and I will let you try again.
  pat $n
  tell $n Begone!
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 18
  mptransfer $n 27714
  endif
 ~
 >speech_prog p Ganalanja sent me~
  if quest(0,5,$n) == 15
  say Very well, then.
  ponder
  say Tell me this....
  ponder
  grin
  tell $n An ornithological specimen.....
  mpechoaround $n {030}Garrawa says 'If you wanted to impress a person...'{300}
  mpecho $i walks across the room.
  tell $n held in digital captivity.....
  mpechoaround $n {030}Garrawa says 'with your great wisdom....'{300}
  mpecho $i walks back.
  tell $n carries the equivalent value as that of.....
  mpechoaround $n {030}Garrawa says 'and you only had the chance to say one thing'{300}
  mpecho $i walks across the room.
  tell $n double the amount in dense foliage.
  mpechoaround $n {030}Garrawa says 'before that person made his decision'{300}
  mpecho $i walks back.
  tell $n In common language, the language of the unlearned,
  mpechoat $n {030}Garrawa asks you 'What did I just say?'{300}
  mpechoaround $n {030}Garrawa says 'what would you say?'{300}
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 16
  endif
