 #27711
 Ganalanja~
 Ganalanja~
 Ganalanja sits here, reading some text.
 ~
 He is wearing the clothes of a great statesman, only these clothes are well worn
 and tattered by the effects of time. He still carries an air of intellectual
 superiority, despite the criticisms of the populace at large. As you watch him,
 he seems to take no notice of you, focusing his attention to the texts at hand.
 His reading speed is overwhelming as he litterally flies through texts, bouncing
 back and forth between a great multitude of scrolls at a frenzied pace, cross
 referencing everything. At times, he stops to scribble something on another
 scroll nearby. This man is obviously one of the few remaining great statesmen
 from times gone by. It would behoove you to learn what you can from this man.
 ~
