 ~
 >speech_prog ~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 12
    say Well well well!
    say You don't look that smart and a reply like that proves it!
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 13
    pat $n
    tell $n Well this is great!  I had a bet with Bidanggu that
    tell $n I would fool you. Go to Bidanggu and say 'another failure
    tell $n coming to see you' and I will let you try again.
    pat $n
    say Now leave my home.
    mpquiet on
    mpforce $n stand
    mpforce $n west
    mpquiet off
 endif
 ~
 >speech_prog p Yannyalu told me she gave you two worthless items.~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 10
    say Ahh, yes she did.
    say Have a seat and rest your weary legs.
    mpquiet on
    mpforce $n rest
    mpquiet off
    say She gave me a pair of gloves, and a pair of boots.
    say I kept the gloves but gave the boots to my friend that needed
    say  them. If you want my gloves so bad, all you have to do is
    say answer a question.
    say Do you wish to take my challenge?
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 11
 endif
 ~
 >speech_prog yes~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 11
    mpechoaround $n $i starts mumbling nonsense.
    tell $n Ok, I once traversed to a land far away and they had
    tell $n a foriegn currency.
    tell $n They went as so:
    tell $n 5 cents = 1 nickel
    tell $n 10 cents = 1 dime
    tell $n 25 cents = 1 quarter
    tell $n 50 cents = half dollar
    tell $n 100 cents = 1 dollar
    tell $n I had 55 cents, only two coins, one not being a half
    tell $n dollar. I did not have a dime and a quarter.
    mpechoat $n {030}Ganalanja asks you 'What coin combination DID I have?'{300}
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 12
 endif
