 #27712
 Ganngalida~
 Ganngalida~
 Ganngalida paces the floor, practicing philosophical speaches to himself.
 ~
 This man, although old, has an obviously large amount of energy as he paces the
 floor constantly with the sure steps of a man far younger than himself. He is
 telling riddles of philosophy to himself as if practicing before delivering
 these riddles to a class of intellectually hungry students. His clothes are well
 worn and the Old Singasis hurl insults at him, making it obvious to you that
 his teaching days in this part of the realms have long since passed. You would
 do well to hear his teachings.
 ~
