 #27714
 Yangal~
 Yangal~
 Yangal stands here, bidding you welcome.
 ~
 She wears clothes of a wealthy debutante, her dress flowing, her jewelry
 glittering, her hair glowing in the sunlight. Her face gleams as she smiles at
 you. Her wealth is far beyond that of the rest of the citizenry and you wonder
 from whence it came. Could she have been born into this wealth? Has she garnered
 this wealth herself? You find it hard to believe such a person could exist in
 this city of foolishness. She appears to have a great wisdom that no other of
 her age and few others older than she even care to obtain here. Perhaps she
 could impart some of her Wisdom on you.
 ~
 ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER
 AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND
 1000 S
 50 BODY_HEAD|BODY_EYE BODY_FOOT|BODY_HIP 1d100+1250 3d8+36
 75000 RACE_GNOME
 POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
 >all_greet_prog 100~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 3
    cackle $n
    say You doubted my wisdom, now get out of my house!
    mpechoat $n {110}You are blown out of $i's home by a strong wind.{300}
    mpmadd $n currhp -10
    mpechoaround $n $n is picked up by a strong wind, throwing $e out of $i's house.
    mptransfer $n 27705
   else
  if quest(0,5,$n) >= 5
   smile $n
  endif
 endif
 ~
 >speech_prog wisdom Wisdom~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 0
    say Hello $n.
    tell $n Ahh, so you feel I am not wise!
    frown
    say Back in the days of Rrrb the Benevolent,
    say I was considered very wise indeed.
    tell $n So do you wish to take the test of wisdom?
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 1
 endif
