 >speech_prog mother mom lady woman female~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 2
    tell $n Exactly!  Very good. I found this band in the
    tell $n trash, why don't you take it.
    mpecho Yangal digs around in the back of the room.
    mpoload 27725
    mpquiet on
    cast 'remove curse'
    mpquiet off
    give i27725 $n
    mpjunk i27725
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 5
    tell $n I found more items like that band in the trash.
    tell $n I gave them to my dear friend, Yannyalu.  I'm sure
    tell $n that she will part with some of them if you
    tell $n can pass her test. Tell her I told you I gave her
    tell $n some items I found in the trash.
    mpechoat $n You leave Yangal's humble abode with a sense of accomplishment.
    mpechoaround $n $n walks out with a swagger in $s step.
    mptransfer $n 27705
 endif
 ~
 >speech_prog ~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 2
    cackle
    tell $n And you thought I wasn't wise!  You can't
    tell $n even answer my simple riddle!
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 3
    tell $n Ok, I will give you another chance, but first
    tell $n go tell my friend that I fooled you. Go to Bidanggu
    tell $n and say 'another failure coming to see you'.
    pat $n
    tell $n Then you can test my wisdom again.
    mpechoat $n You dejectedly leave $i's house.
    mpechoaround $n $n looks very sad as $e leaves $i's home.
    mptransfer $n 27705
   else
    if quest(0,5,$n) > 5
    smile
    tell $n You have already been here.
 endif
 ~
 >speech_prog yes~
 if quest(0,5,$n) == 1
    say Very well then.
    mpecho Yangal ponders for a quick second.
    say Here is a quick riddle, answer it correctly and
    say I will reward you.
    tell $n A man and his son are in a chariot crash. The man dies,
    mpechoaround $n {030}Yangal says 'If you wanted to cook a good fish'{300}
    tell $n but his son is taken to the witchdoctor to be healed.
    mpechoaround $n {030}Yangal says 'and you didn't have any firewood'{300}
    tell $n The witchdoctor says "I cannot work on him,
    mpechoaround $n {030}Yangal says 'What would be the best kind of'{300}
    tell $n he is my son."
    mpechoaround $n {030}Yangal says 'tree to cut down?'{300}
    mpechoat $n {030}Yangal asks you 'How is it possible?'{300}
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 2
 endif
