 Ngurrinji~
 Ngurrinji impatiently awaits your decision.
 ~
 His arms are very large and scarred by the many years of work with metals,
 making a wide variety of weapon and repairing an even wider variety. Upon closer
 examination, you see scars that appear to be from some kind of explosive. His
 attire is caked with black dust from his kilns, as is his face and arms.
