 #27723
 kanjamalak~
 Kanjamalak~
 Kanjamalak stands here, writing scrolls.
 ~
 She appears to be quite old and forgetful as she writes scrolls. She seems to
 have no idea as to the reason for the scrolls. There must have been a time when
 she was a great spellcaster, but that had to have been in the distant past. Her
 clothes are in a state of great disarray and have long since outlived their
 usefulness.
 ~
