 #OBJECTS
 #27700
 Fountain~
 An old fountain~
 An old fountain sprays water sporadically.~
 The fountain is molded in the shape of a person, standing fifteen feet tall.
 Its once great beauty has been worn down and discolored over the centuries. You
 can see where a few careless repairs have been made to its workings. Birds have
 used it for bathing and left deposits behind. From time to time it shoots a 
 weak stream of water into the air, then returns to its incessant gurgling. It is
 a shame to see such a work of art in such a sad condition.
 ~
 ITEM_TYPE_FOUNTAIN
 ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
 0
 0 0 0 0
 0 100000 1
 #27701
 Statue~
 A statue of a man~
 A statue of a man stands in the middle of the boulevard.~
 This statue is quite peculiar. It doesn't seem to represent a warrior of any
 kind. The man seems diminutive, weak, and quite elderly. You wonder what these
 people revere to have a statue of some worthless man standing here. The statue
 looks as if it has been here for centuries and has been less than admirably
 cared for. Birds have been permitted to build their nests on it with not even
 the least disruption to their building.
 ~
 ITEM_TYPE_FURNITURE
 ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
 0
 0 0 0 0
 0 1000000 1
 #27702
 Statue~
 A statue of a woman~
 A statue of a woman stands in the middle of the boulevard.~
 You are immediately impressed by the absolute unimpressiveness of the woman
 portrayed here. She is of barely average beauty and slightly advanced in years.
 She has only the slightest smile which, as you look more closely seems to be
 more of a sly smirk. Her hands are folded neatly behind her back in a fashion
 as to give an authoritarian air. The statue has long been in need of upkeep.
 But the birds seem to like it.
 ~
 ITEM_TYPE_FURNITURE
 ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
