 Old Singase Square~
 You are in the center of town. All around you, you see signs of a once great
 trading center, although it is now in a state of rapid decay as the citizenry
 has a very indifferent attitude toward its upkeep. They seem to worship the
 god of sloth here, or so it appears.
 ~
