 #27701
 Chakkor Avenue~
 This avenue, named for one of the great cities of the realms, was built to honor
 the rulers of Chakkor. It was once a beautiful avenue through the city but has
 been worn down by travel and lack of care. The avenue was built using the style
 of Chakkorian architects, the buildings lining it built in glorious Chakkorian
 flair. The well worn flagstones to the west and east are testament to the large
 amount of travellers that have passed this way.
 ~
