 #27801
 On The City Wall~
 You are walking on the protective wall which surrounds the city. It is made of
 huge cut granite and marble stones, mortared together with a glassy black
 substance. As the wind picks up, you feel the wall swaying slightly. Taking
 into account the massive breadth of the wall here, it is definitely not a good
 sign when the wall starts to sway. You begin to wonder how to get off this
 junk heap.
 ~
