 #27807
 On The City Wall~
 You are walking on the protective wall which surrounds the city. As you look
 around at the village below, your stomach turns at the disgusting sight
 filling your eyes. There are trees growing out of the roofs of many a house
 while right next door, at times, there are elaborately expensive homes. It
 is quite obvious that the wealthier residents don't care at all what happens
 to the poor among them.
 ~
