 #27808
 On The City Wall~
 You are walking on the protective wall which surrounds the city. As you
 take time to scan the scenery, you wonder who in their right minds would
 want to attack such a wretched place. At least the garbage is being kept
 within the village, but somehow you doubt that was the original intent,
 the protecting of the realms from the garbage of the village.
 ~
