 #27809
 Mabo's Diner~
 You have entered an old diner. The stench of hastily prepared food is enough to
 dismiss your hunger. You see bugs crawling across the floor, counters and tables
 completing the job the aroma started. It is a wonder Mabo makes any money
 selling his food.
 ~
