 #27810
 Darby's Armor~
 Old overly stressed armor hangs on the walls and is strewn throughout the shop.
 Darby seems totally uninterested in cleanliness. You think you saw a rat
 scurrying through the pieces of armor. Many of the straps show signs of chewing
 and gnawing. This hardly looks like a place to buy decent armor.
 ~
